[{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4119643581", "html_url": "https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/2821#issuecomment-4119643581", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/2821", "id": 4119643581, "node_id": "IC_kwDOPRF1G871jMW9", "user": {"login": "Mibayy", "id": 97958526, "node_id": "U_kgDOBda6fg", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97958526?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/Mibayy", "html_url": "https://github.com/Mibayy", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Mibayy/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Mibayy/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Mibayy/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Mibayy/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Mibayy/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Mibayy/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Mibayy/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Mibayy/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Mibayy/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2026-03-24T16:25:38Z", "updated_at": "2026-03-24T16:25:38Z", "body": "**Root cause identified**\n\n`litellm` is not a direct dependency of hermes-agent \u2014 it's pulled in transitively by the optional `yc-bench` extra:\n\n```toml\n# pyproject.toml\nyc-bench = [\"yc-bench @ git+https://github.com/collinear-ai/yc-bench.git ; python_version >= '3.12'\"]\n```\n\n`yc-bench` requires `litellm`, and `litellm>=1.75.5` has no prebuilt wheel for your platform (Termux / proot-ubuntu on ARM). The install script runs `uv pip install -e \".[all]\"` which drags in `yc-bench` and therefore litellm.\n\n**Workarounds (pick one)**\n\n**Option 1 \u2014 skip the `yc-bench` extra (recommended)**\n\nInstall without `[all]`, manually adding only the extras you need:\n\n```bash\nuv pip install -e \".[messaging,cron,mcp,pty,cli]\"\n```\n\nOr skip extras entirely for a minimal install:\n\n```bash\nuv pip install -e .\n```\n\n**Option 2 \u2014 install from `requirements.txt` (no extras)**\n\n```bash\nuv pip install -r requirements.txt\n# or\npip install -r requirements.txt\n```\n\n**Option 3 \u2014 build litellm from source**\n\nIf you specifically need `yc-bench`:\n\n```bash\npip install --no-binary litellm litellm\nuv pip install -e \".[all]\"\n```\n\n---\n\n**For maintainers**: the `[all]` meta-extra implicitly pulls in `yc-bench` which brings a heavy ML benchmarking dependency (`litellm`, `streamlit`, `plotly`) that breaks on constrained environments. Consider excluding `yc-bench` from `[all]` since it's a niche benchmark tool, not a standard integration.", "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4119643581/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4119683243", "html_url": "https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/2821#issuecomment-4119683243", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/2821", "id": 4119683243, "node_id": "IC_kwDOPRF1G871jWCr", "user": {"login": "devorun", "id": 130918800, "node_id": "U_kgDOB82pkA", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/130918800?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/devorun", "html_url": "https://github.com/devorun", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/devorun/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/devorun/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/devorun/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/devorun/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/devorun/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/devorun/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/devorun/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/devorun/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/devorun/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2026-03-24T16:31:39Z", "updated_at": "2026-03-24T16:31:39Z", "body": "Hello The specific error you encountered (`No matching distribution found for litellm`) was not a Termux/Android compatibility issue. It was caused by `litellm` being quarantined on PyPI globally due to a security issue.\n\nThe maintainers have just released a hotfix (check the Discord announcements) that completely removes `litellm` from the installation requirements. If you run the install script again now, it will bypass this specific error. \n", "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4119683243/reactions", "total_count": 1, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 1, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4119719730", "html_url": "https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/2821#issuecomment-4119719730", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/2821", "id": 4119719730, "node_id": "IC_kwDOPRF1G871je8y", "user": {"login": "VictorR29", "id": 54075687, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjU0MDc1Njg3", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54075687?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/VictorR29", "html_url": "https://github.com/VictorR29", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/VictorR29/followers", "f